         </span> Practical Guide</a></p>
<h1 class="title title"><span class="title__item">Accommodation</span></h1>
</div>
<div class="b-detail">
    <div class="grid grid--0">
        <div class="grid__cell size--t-4-12 holder holder--lg b-detail__menu b-detail__menu--arrow">
            <div data-sticky-container>
            
<nav class="m-content" role="navigation" data-sticky data-waypoints>
<h2 class="m-content__title h3">Contents</h2>
<ol class="m-content__list">

        <li class="m-content__item">
            
        <a href="#but-accommodation" class="m-content__link">
            <span class="icon-svg icon-svg--angle-r m-content__icon">
                <svg class="icon-svg__svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink">
